#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:5 56eb6ec19a084344a457a9c6de248e65
msgid "QuikTune"
msgstr "QuikTune"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:10 067f704a76364d3d9ca836c467bdc372
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `VTOL QuikTune "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets"
"/VTOL-quicktune.md>`__ Lua script simplifies the process of finding a "
"good tune for a multicopter's attitude control parameters."
msgstr ""
"`VTOL QuikTune "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/Copter-4.5/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets"
"/VTOL-quicktune.md>`__ Lua脚本简化了为多旋翼飞行器姿态控制参数寻找良好调参结果的过程。"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:12 5d771dfff3a345d9ad125023a95c782f
msgid ""
"The script slowly increases the relevant gains until it detects an "
"oscillation.  It then reduces the gains by 60% and moves onto the next "
"gain. Once all the gains have been tuned the tune completes and the user "
"can decide to save or discard the new gains."
msgstr "脚本会缓慢增大相关增益，直到检测到振荡。随后将增益降低60%，然后继续调整下一个增益。所有增益调参完成后，调参结束，用户可选择保存或放弃新的增益值。"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:15 9b6d0be6b5f6471f9dd8582e31d62955
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"be sure that you have prepared the vehicle for tuning by setting up "
"parameters discussed here: :ref:`setting-up-for-tuning`. Also to assure "
"the best tune, setup the noise notch filtering, see :ref:`common-imu-"
"notch-filtering`. You may run QuickTune without this step to obtain "
"initial fine tune, see :ref:`ac_rollpitchtuning` if the vehicle can't do "
"an initial hover stably. Then setup the filters and retune for best "
"results."
msgstr ""
"请确保已按此处讨论的参数设置做好飞行器调参准备：:ref:`setting-up-for-"
"tuning`。为确保最佳调参效果，还需设置噪声陷波滤波器，请参阅 :ref:`common-imu-notch-"
"filtering`。如果飞行器无法稳定悬停，可先不设置此步骤直接运行QuickTune进行初步调参，参见 "
":ref:`ac_rollpitchtuning`。然后再设置滤波器并重新调参以获得最佳效果。"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:17 b272e4391aaa421f9ea0a9ae58cd3a0e
msgid "The script attempts to tune all these parameters (in the given order)"
msgstr "脚本将尝试调整所有这些参数（按给定顺序）"

