#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:26 b240c39e00b246eabf578b5ee6b498cd
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The advantage over :ref:`AutoTune <autotune>` is that QuikTune is safer "
"because the vehicle does not need to move or twitch. The disadvantage is "
"that QuikTune cannot find the vehicle's maximum rotational accelerations "
"(e.g. :ref:`ATC_ACC_R_MAX<ATC_ACC_R_MAX>`, "
":ref:`ATC_ACC_P_MAX<ATC_ACC_P_MAX>`, :ref:`ATC_ACC_Y_MAX<ATC_ACC_Y_MAX>`)"
msgstr ""
"相比 :ref:`AutoTune "
"<autotune>`，QuikTune的优势在于更安全，因为飞行器无需移动或抖动。其缺点是QuikTune无法找到飞行器的最大旋转加速度（例如 "
":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX>`、:ref:`ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX "
"<ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX>`、:ref:`ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:30 0f9cbc2798694e6ca17bda5d4e0c5499
msgid "Installing the Script"
msgstr "安装脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:32 5e7123e934e84c3a8b3808cf301ee3f1
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SCR_ENABLE <SCR_ENABLE>` = 1 to enable scripting and then "
"reboot the autopilot"
msgstr "将 :ref:`SCR_ENABLE <SCR_ENABLE>` = 1 以启用脚本功能，然后重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:33 eba6d04a2ffd4391a7e9f4de57a83fb1
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Download `VTOL-quicktune.lua "
"<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets"
"/VTOL-quicktune.lua>`__ to your PC"
msgstr ""
"将 `VTOL-quicktune.lua "
"<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/Copter-4.5/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets"
"/VTOL-quicktune.lua>`__ 下载到您的电脑"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:34 ed12c28f841141e8bfb40d23a937accb
msgid ""
"Copy the script to your autopilot's SD card's APM/scripts directory.  If "
"using MP it may be easiest to use the Config, MAVFtp screen"
msgstr "将脚本复制到飞控 SD 卡的 APM/scripts 目录。如果使用 MP，可以通过 Config、MAVFtp 界面操作，较为方便"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:40 38e18bf451024840a659cec230e34740
msgid "Reboot the autopilot and set QUIK_ENABLE = 1"
msgstr "重启飞控并设置QUIK_ENABLE = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:41 a4823d5da4834a68b5f867527478fea7
msgid ""
"If an RC switch will be used to start/stop the tune set RCx_OPTION = 300 "
"where \"x\" is the RC input channel number.  Alternatively set one of "
"Mission Planner's Aux Function tab's rows to \"Scripting1\""
msgstr ""
"若要使用遥控开关来启动/停止调参，请将 RCx_OPTION = 300（其中 「x」 为 RC 输入通道编号）。也可在 Mission "
"Planner 的 Aux Function 选项卡中将某行设为 「Scripting1」"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:48 f2d15b1ff2db4954a29e916609797e83
msgid "Running QuikTune"
msgstr "运行QuikTune"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:50 a71ce3eeac25456dbdef175d5e61a32b
msgid "Wait for a calm day and go to an open area with good GPS reception"
msgstr "选择平静的天气，前往有良好 GPS 信号的开阔区域"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:51 f5dba2d9b9714890b242d74178636799
msgid ""
"Connect with a ground station (e.g Mission Planner or QGC) and ensure "
"that the Messages tab can be seen.  This is where output from the tune "
"will appear"
msgstr "使用地面站（如 Mission Planner 或QGroundControl）连接飞行器，并确保能看到消息标签页。调参过程中的输出信息将显示在此处"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:52 6cdbb2664e764f48b5186103f6bd88e0
msgid ""
"Move the RC switch to the low position OR push MP's Aux Function's "
"\"Low\" button"
msgstr "将 RC 开关拨到低位，或按下 Mission Planner 辅助功能中的「Low」按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:53 f5441fb5e1954dca8c7d2c2a6a683176
msgid "Arm and takeoff in Loiter mode and climb to a height of about 3m"
msgstr "在Loiter模式下解锁并起飞，爬升至约3米高度"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:54 ac0e5f6afc5b46e0a774f31c9fb0b078
msgid ""
"Begin the tune by moving the RC switch to the middle position OR push "
"MP's Aux Function's \"Mid\" button"
msgstr "将遥控开关拨到中位，或按下 MP Aux Function 的 「Mid」 按钮以开始调参"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:55 d325026c07654cfd8158ffd77cab3478
msgid "Monitor the progress of the tune using the GCS's Messages tab"
msgstr "通过地面站的消息标签页监控调参进度"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:56 8c6ed0223d9a4d32bf054b8efb30e986
msgid ""
"If necessary reposition the vehicle using the RC transmitter.  This will "
"temporarily pause tuning and restore the original gains.  Tuning will "
"resume a few seconds after the RC sticks are returned to their center "
"position"
msgstr "如有必要，可使用RC遥控器重新调整飞行器位置。这将暂时暂停调参并恢复原始增益值。摇杆回中几秒后调参将自动恢复"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:57 adec6c8e95f541d4ba38b29fd869de92
msgid ""
"If the vehicle begins oscillating violently cancel the tune by moving the"
" RC switch to the low position OR push MP's Aux Function's \"Low\" button"
msgstr "若车辆开始剧烈振荡，请将遥控开关拨回低位，或按下 MP Aux Function 的 「Low」 按钮以取消调参"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:58 70cd0f985f29436f9250638f5ef0b480
msgid ""
"Once the tune has completed accept the new gains by moving the RC aux "
"switch to the high position OR push MP's Aux Function's \"High\" button"
msgstr "调参完成后，将RC辅助拨杆拨到高位或按下MP辅助功能的\"High\"按钮以接受新增益值"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:59 83e4aa9bfac0494baa5f3a8787bbb037
msgid "Land and disarm the vehicle"
msgstr "降落并上锁飞行器"

